# Cloudflare Pages routing rules.
#
# The site is a single-page app with client-side routes (/ueber-veytaro,
# /dokumentation, /bedingungen, /kontakt). Without this rule, loading or
# refreshing one of those URLs asks the static host for a file that does not
# exist and returns 404 before React ever runs.
#
# Rewriting to index.html with status 200 (not a 301/302 redirect) keeps the
# original URL in the address bar, so the router still sees the right path.
#
# Real files — /downloads/*, /og-image.png, /favicon.ico and so on — are served
# directly, because Cloudflare Pages matches assets on disk before it applies
# these rules.
/*    /index.html   200
